    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/levin-2018-hcn2-16> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2018-hcn2-16--grok--operationalizability> .
